    "boundary. `hook` picks the generated script (shell -> system2-shell-guard.js,",
    "edit -> system2-edit-guard.js). `event` is the stdin JSON. `expect` is `block`",
    "or `allow`. `reason_contains` is the substring the block reason MUST carry.",
    "`env` (optional) sets SYSTEM2_ACTIVE_ROLE (in-session role switch). `pi_parity`",
    "lists the Pi proven-blocking corpus case names this Codex-event-shaped case is",
    "the normalized-input counterpart of (F8 parity at the normalized-input boundary,",
    "design line 171). Cases with empty `pi_parity` are Codex-specific breadth the Pi",
    "corpus does not enumerate (extra dangerous commands, chains, heredocs, argv/key",
    "event-shape variants, apply_patch payloads). Data only — never eval'd."
  ],
